# Worldspine Wurm: cast on turn three from eleven mana, it dies to Bot2's Wrath of God on turn four. Its death makes
# three 5/5 green Wurm tokens with trample, and being put into a graveyard shuffles the card itself into its owner's
# library, so only the Black Lotus is in Bot1's graveyard and the library grows by one.

